# No client-side configuration is required.
#
# The basemap is OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org), which needs no API key,
# no signup and no billing. The map renders on a fresh clone.
#
# The dev server proxies the prediction API; point it somewhere other than
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 by setting VITE_API_TARGET in the shell before `npm run dev`.
